  Content: A class of |magical computing devices| that utilize free-text input peripherals.
    The original Typocrypha was invented in 2011 by technology conglomerate |Ostanes|
    to combat |Demons|. While originally designed purely for combat against magical
    beings, modern Typocrypha have been augmented with various general use functionality
    (communicators, |Coil| search, navigation, etc).
